  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Serbia Asset Registry</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed IDF grant would support the government&apos;s agenda by allowing the Property Directorate to investigate good practices in countries with similar central asset  registers, specifically France and Sweden, and provide professional and technical advice and support to redesign processes and practices that are more in line with best practices in asset records management. TF093849 The grant will improve the quality, comprehensiveness and transparency of financial information on tangible assets for the Republic of Serbia (RoS). Tangible assets records maintained by the Property Directorate include land, buildings, vehicles, equipment, furniture and fittings and other material movable and immovable property. As a consequence, it will provide a strong foundation for better management of, and accountability for, non-financial assets at all levels of government.</narrative>
  </description>
